sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User
  participant S as Supervisor
  participant A as Worker A
  participant B as Worker B

  U->>S: one question
  Note over S: MODEL CALL 1 — which worker?
  S->>A: delegate
  Note over A: MODEL CALL 2 — do the work
  A->>S: result
  Note over S: MODEL CALL 3 — what next?
  S->>B: delegate
  Note over B: MODEL CALL 4 — do the work
  B->>S: result
  Note over S: MODEL CALL 5 — compose the answer
  S-->>U: answer

  Note over U,B: MEASURED: 5 model calls against the single agent's 2,<br/>and 2.8x the context, because every router turn<br/>re-reads the whole accumulating conversation.
